    fix(vector): exact T-junction projection on the grid; ADR-0017 argument for the remaining f64 parameters
    
    Per the orchestrator's ruling on edits 32-33: T-junction ends are projected exactly
    (integer closest point rounded half to even, exact tolerance and nearest choice), so
    every junction coordinate is integer arithmetic; ADR-0017 (15) shows why the remaining
    f64 path parameters cannot affect cross-OS determinism or translation covariance.
    
